  "body": "Tucked well away from the road and offering exceptional privacy, this beautifully renovated freehold home is the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and lifestyle. Featuring three bedrooms, open planned living and dining area, modern kitchen and bathroom with ample off-street parking and a good outdoor area perfect for relaxing, entertaining, or family enjoyment. As an added bonus, the vendor has upgraded the home with double-glazed windows, enhancing comfort and energy efficiency. This move-in-ready gem in such a highly sought-after location is one not to be missed. \r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Half Moon Bay, you'll enjoy the ultimate in everyday convenience. Families will appreciate the outstanding school zoning, including Waakaranga Primary School, Farm Cove Intermediate, and Pakuranga College, with Pakuranga College within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nEnjoy being just moments from Highland Park Shopping Centre, Lloyd Elsmore Park, and Half Moon Bay Marina, providing excellent shopping, dining, recreation, and transport options.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer looking to get onto the property ladder, a downsizer seeking comfort and convenience, or a savvy investor searching for a quality addition to your portfolio, this attractive home is sure to impress.\r\n\r\nThis is an outstanding opportunity to secure a comfortable and move-in-ready home in a popular and family-friendly location. Overseas vendor says it sell. Act quickly to make it yours.",
